Original drawn interpretation of a documented experiment, not footage of the event. الفكرة العلمية: Kendra Lemke & Meredith Faulkner (Lockview High School). Experiment performed by CSA astronaut Chris Hadfield aboard the ISS. Canadian Space Agency published the demonstration on 16 April 2013: https://www.asc-csa.gc.ca/eng/multimedia/search/video/17862 . No footage, music, voice recording, government mark or endorsement from CSA or NASA is included.
Original anime staging, seven AI-assisted model/background paintings, hand-coded replacement cels and effects, local ten-colour separations, original pentatonic score and Foley for this production. The only spoken sentence is a question from the Arabic studio narrator (synthetic voice-00), not a quotation or imitation of the astronaut. All artwork and sound are newly made for this film. Diagrams and the ordinary Earth sink are explanatory illustrations.
